Structural graph queries (blueprint module)

Usage: instrukt blueprint <COMMAND>

Commands:
  affected  What depends on the given files, from the latest graph
  path      The shortest chain of links from A to B in the latest graph
  query     A free question to the engine, where it offers one
  explain   The engine's explanation of a node, where it offers one
  status    The last generation's outcome
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
